## 四、接口说明

### 我调用的后端接口（Spring Boot）

| 接口                            | 方法   | 作用         | 调用位置                           |
| ------------------------------- | ------ | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |
| `/api/submissions`              | GET    | 获取申报列表 | Home.js loadSubmissions            |
| `/api/submissions`              | POST   | 创建申报     | SubmissionCreate.js handleSubmit   |
| `/api/submissions/:id`          | GET    | 获取申报详情 | SubmissionDetail.js loadSubmission |
| `/api/submissions/:id`          | PUT    | 更新申报     | SubmissionDetail.js handleSave     |
| `/api/submissions/:id`          | DELETE | 删除申报     | Home.js handleDelete               |
| `/api/submissions/:id/submit`   | POST   | 提交申报     | Home.js handleSubmit               |
| `/api/submissions/:id/withdraw` | POST   | 撤回申报     | Home.js handleWithdraw             |
| `/api/upload`                   | POST   | 文件上传     | SubmissionCreate.js Upload         |

### 响应数据格式

Spring Boot 后端返回 `Result<T>`：

```javascript
// 响应结构
{
  code: 200,
  message: "操作成功",
  data: [...]  // 实际业务数据
}

// 前端提取数据
const res = await submissionAPI.getList();
setSubmissions(res.data.data || []);  // res.data 是 Result，res.data.data 是业务数据
```

